sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Widget as Widget Chat
    participant SupportModule as Module Support
    participant DB as Base PostgreSQL
    actor Agent as Agent Support
    participant AdminUI as Interface Admin

    Client->>Widget: Ouvrir le chat
    Widget->>SupportModule: Charger conversation active
    SupportModule->>DB: SELECT conversation + messages visibles
    DB-->>SupportModule: Historique messages
    SupportModule-->>Widget: Afficher conversation

    Client->>Widget: Envoyer message
    Widget->>SupportModule: POST message client
    SupportModule->>DB: INSERT support_message(status=sent)
    SupportModule-->>Widget: Message enregistré

    AdminUI->>SupportModule: Consulter conversations
    SupportModule->>DB: SELECT conversations non lues
    DB-->>SupportModule: Liste conversations
    SupportModule-->>AdminUI: Afficher inbox support

    Agent->>AdminUI: Ouvrir conversation
    AdminUI->>SupportModule: Marquer messages comme read
    SupportModule->>DB: UPDATE messages status=read
    SupportModule-->>AdminUI: Historique complet

    Agent->>AdminUI: Répondre au client
    AdminUI->>SupportModule: POST message support
    SupportModule->>DB: INSERT support_message(sender=support)
    SupportModule-->>AdminUI: Réponse enregistrée

    Widget->>SupportModule: Polling toutes les 5 secondes
    SupportModule->>DB: SELECT nouveaux messages
    DB-->>SupportModule: Réponse support
    SupportModule-->>Widget: Afficher nouveau message
